% Rx_SchwarzschildEP -- tTraceRestart.  TO's dyson5 R2c two-mirror modified
% Schwarzschild (1.5k module) whose entrance-pupil Reference (elt 1, the
% stop) sits 5.3 mm ahead of the CONVEX hyperboloidal primary (elt 2).  A
% ray 90 mm off axis there has the two conic roots -0.107 / +0.011 m; the
% pre-2026-10-03 ifLNsrf root pick (|L^2 - mpr| proximity, mpr the squared
% distance to the VERTEX, lateral height included) chose the sheet BEHIND
% the ray -- a 93 mm rms spot from a one-call trace, while a stepwise trace
% was right by accident (stale PrevNonSeg across rays).  Copied verbatim
% from challenges/dyson5/dyson5_t4_r2c_1k5_r2_1500.in; do not regenerate.
